<%- include('../../partials/header') %>
<style>
body{background:#f0f4ff;}
.oh-hub{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;}
.oh-bc{font-size:.8rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:1.25rem;}
.oh-bc a{color:#64748b;text-decoration:none;}
.oh-hero{text-align:center;margin-bottom:3rem;}
.oh-hero h1{font-size:2.3rem;color:#0f172a;margin:0 0 1rem;line-height:1.2;}
.oh-hero p{font-size:1.1rem;color:#475569;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;line-height:1.7;}
.oh-badge-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:.6rem;margin-bottom:.5rem;}
.oh-badge{background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;color:#1d4ed8;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;padding:.35rem .85rem;border-radius:20px;}
.oh-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:3rem;}
.oh-card{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;border:1.5px solid #e8edf5;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.05);padding:1.75rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s,transform .15s;text-decoration:none;}
.oh-card:hover{border-color:#1d4ed8;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(29,78,216,.14);transform:translateY(-3px);}
.oh-card-icon{font-size:2rem;line-height:1;}
.oh-card h2{font-size:1.15rem;color:#0f172a;margin:0;font-weight:700;}
.oh-card p{font-size:.88rem;color:#64748b;margin:0;line-height:1.6;}
.oh-card-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin-top:.25rem;}
.oh-tag{font-size:.72rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;padding:.2rem .55rem;border-radius:10px;font-weight:500;}
.oh-card-cta{margin-top:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;color:#1d4ed8;}
.oh-card.featured{border-color:#1d4ed8;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#eff6ff 0%,#fff 60%);}
.oh-card.featured h2{color:#1d4ed8;}
.oh-why{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #e8edf5;padding:2.25rem;margin-bottom:2rem;}
.oh-why h2{font-size:1.5rem;color:#0f172a;margin:0 0 1rem;padding-bottom:.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #eff6ff;}
.oh-why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1rem;}
.oh-why-item{display:flex;gap:.85rem;align-items:flex-start;}
.oh-why-icon{font-size:1.4rem;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:.1rem;}
.oh-why-text h3{font-size:.98rem;color:#0f172a;margin:0 0 .25rem;font-weight:700;}
.oh-why-text p{font-size:.87rem;color:#64748b;margin:0;line-height:1.55;}
.oh-faq{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #e8edf5;padding:2.25rem;margin-bottom:2rem;}
.oh-faq h2{font-size:1.5rem;color:#0f172a;margin:0 0 1.25rem;padding-bottom:.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #eff6ff;}
.oh-faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;padding:.9rem 0;}
.oh-faq-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.oh-faq-q{font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;font-size:.97rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;}
.oh-faq-a{color:#475569;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.65;}
@media(max-width:900px){.oh-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
@media(max-width:600px){.oh-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.oh-why-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.oh-hero h1{font-size:1.7rem;}}
</style>

<main id="main-content">
<div class="oh-hub">
  <div class="oh-bc">
    <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/index.php">Home</a> › Ohio Payroll Calculators
  </div>

  <div class="oh-hero">
    <h1>Ohio Payroll Calculators (<%= currentYear %>)</h1>
    <p>Free, accurate Ohio payroll tools built with real <strong>IRS federal tax brackets</strong>, <strong>Ohio progressive state tax rates</strong>, and <strong>municipal income tax</strong> support. Pick the calculator that fits your situation.</p>
    <div class="oh-badge-row">
      <span class="oh-badge">✅ Real Ohio Tax Brackets</span>
      <span class="oh-badge">✅ All Filing Statuses</span>
      <span class="oh-badge">✅ Municipality Support</span>
      <span class="oh-badge">✅ Pre-Tax Deductions</span>
      <span class="oh-badge">✅ Overtime &amp; Bonus</span>
      <span class="oh-badge">✅ Free &amp; No Login</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CALCULATOR GRID -->
  <div class="oh-grid">

    <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/paycheck-calculator" class="oh-card featured">
      <div class="oh-card-icon">💵</div>
      <h2>Ohio Paycheck Calculator</h2>
      <p>Full-featured professional payroll calculator. All filing statuses, municipality dropdown, pre-tax deductions, 401(k), HSA, bonus &amp; overtime — the most comprehensive Ohio paycheck tool.</p>
      <div class="oh-card-tags">
        <span class="oh-tag">All Filing Statuses</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Municipality Tax</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Pre-Tax Deductions</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Bonus & OT</span>
      </div>
      <span class="oh-card-cta">Calculate Paycheck →</span>
    </a>

    <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/hourly-paycheck-calculator" class="oh-card">
      <div class="oh-card-icon">⏱️</div>
      <h2>Ohio Hourly Paycheck Calculator</h2>
      <p>Enter your hourly rate, hours worked, and overtime hours. Instantly see gross pay and net take-home pay after all Ohio taxes for any pay period.</p>
      <div class="oh-card-tags">
        <span class="oh-tag">Hourly Rate</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">OT Hours</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Weekly / Biweekly</span>
      </div>
      <span class="oh-card-cta">Calculate Hourly Pay →</span>
    </a>

    <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/salary-paycheck-calculator" class="oh-card">
      <div class="oh-card-icon">📊</div>
      <h2>Ohio Salary Paycheck Calculator</h2>
      <p>Convert your annual salary to any pay frequency and see your estimated net paycheck after federal, Ohio state, and local taxes.</p>
      <div class="oh-card-tags">
        <span class="oh-tag">Annual Salary</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">All Frequencies</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Per-Paycheck Net</span>
      </div>
      <span class="oh-card-cta">Calculate Salary Pay →</span>
    </a>

    <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/overtime-calculator" class="oh-card">
      <div class="oh-card-icon">🕐</div>
      <h2>Ohio Overtime Calculator</h2>
      <p>Calculate overtime pay under FLSA rules (1.5× after 40 hrs/week). See gross overtime earnings, taxes, and take-home for Ohio employees.</p>
      <div class="oh-card-tags">
        <span class="oh-tag">FLSA 1.5× Rule</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Regular + OT Pay</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">After-Tax OT</span>
      </div>
      <span class="oh-card-cta">Calculate Overtime →</span>
    </a>

    <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/bonus-tax-calculator" class="oh-card">
      <div class="oh-card-icon">🎯</div>
      <h2>Ohio Bonus Tax Calculator</h2>
      <p>Bonuses are taxed as supplemental wages at a flat 22% federal rate (or aggregate method). See exactly how much of your Ohio bonus you'll keep.</p>
      <div class="oh-card-tags">
        <span class="oh-tag">22% Flat Method</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Aggregate Method</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Ohio State Tax</span>
      </div>
      <span class="oh-card-cta">Calculate Bonus Tax →</span>
    </a>

    <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/payroll-tax-calculator" class="oh-card">
      <div class="oh-card-icon">🏢</div>
      <h2>Ohio Payroll Tax Calculator</h2>
      <p>Employer-side payroll tax estimator. Calculate total employer cost including FICA match, FUTA, Ohio SUI, and total compensation cost per employee.</p>
      <div class="oh-card-tags">
        <span class="oh-tag">Employer FICA Match</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">FUTA / Ohio SUI</span>
        <span class="oh-tag">Total Labor Cost</span>
      </div>
      <span class="oh-card-cta">Calculate Payroll Taxes →</span>
    </a>

  </div>

  <!-- WHY THESE CALCULATORS -->
  <div class="oh-why">
    <h2>Why These Calculators Are More Accurate</h2>
    <div class="oh-why-grid">
      <div class="oh-why-item">
        <span class="oh-why-icon">📐</span>
        <div class="oh-why-text">
          <h3>Real IRS Federal Tax Brackets</h3>
          <p>Not a flat 12% estimate — these calculators use the actual <%= currentYear %> progressive federal brackets for Single, Married Filing Jointly, Married Filing Separately, Head of Household, and Qualifying Surviving Spouse.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="oh-why-item">
        <span class="oh-why-icon">🏛️</span>
        <div class="oh-why-text">
          <h3>Ohio Progressive State Brackets</h3>
          <p>Ohio doesn't use a flat tax. The state applies graduated rates across multiple income brackets. These calculators use current Ohio Department of Taxation withholding tables.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="oh-why-item">
        <span class="oh-why-icon">🏙️</span>
        <div class="oh-why-text">
          <h3>Municipal Income Tax Support</h3>
          <p>Over 600 Ohio cities charge local income taxes. Columbus (2.5%), Cleveland (2.0%), Akron (2.5%), Toledo (2.25%), and Cincinnati (1.8%) are all supported via a municipality dropdown.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="oh-why-item">
        <span class="oh-why-icon">💼</span>
        <div class="oh-why-text">
          <h3>Pre-Tax Deductions Reduce Taxable Income</h3>
          <p>401(k), HSA, FSA, and health insurance premiums are subtracted before taxes are calculated — because that's how real payroll works and it significantly impacts your take-home estimate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <div class="oh-faq">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="oh-faq-item">
      <div class="oh-faq-q">Which Ohio paycheck calculator should I use?</div>
      <div class="oh-faq-a">If you receive a salary or want the most comprehensive result, use the full <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/paycheck-calculator">Ohio Paycheck Calculator</a>. For hourly workers, the <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/hourly-paycheck-calculator">Hourly Paycheck Calculator</a> lets you enter hours directly. For bonus withholding, use the <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/bonus-tax-calculator">Bonus Tax Calculator</a>.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="oh-faq-item">
      <div class="oh-faq-q">Do Ohio calculators include local municipal taxes?</div>
      <div class="oh-faq-a">Yes. Every calculator in this suite includes a municipality field where you can select your Ohio city or enter a custom local tax rate. Major cities like Columbus, Cleveland, Cincinnati, Toledo, Akron, and Dayton are pre-loaded.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="oh-faq-item">
      <div class="oh-faq-q">Are these calculators accurate for <%= currentYear %>?</div>
      <div class="oh-faq-a">These calculators use <%= currentYear %> federal brackets, Ohio state withholding tables, and current FICA rates. Tax laws change annually — always verify final figures with a payroll professional or the IRS/Ohio Department of Taxation.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="oh-faq-item">
      <div class="oh-faq-q">What is Ohio's state income tax rate?</div>
      <div class="oh-faq-a">Ohio uses a progressive tax system. Income below ~$26,050 is taxed at 0%. Above that, rates range up to approximately 3.5% for higher incomes. Ohio periodically adjusts its brackets — the calculators reflect the most current rates.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="oh-faq-item">
      <div class="oh-faq-q">Can employers use these calculators?</div>
      <div class="oh-faq-a">Yes. The <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/ohio/payroll-tax-calculator">Ohio Payroll Tax Calculator</a> is specifically designed for employers to estimate total labor cost including FICA match, FUTA, and Ohio SUI contributions per employee.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</main>
<%- include('../../partials/footer') %>
